---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us" description="Qaraye Marchants - Nigeria's agricultural marketplace connecting verified merchants with buyers.">
  <div class="container" style="padding: 60px 24px; max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 style="font-family: var(--display); font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--ink);">About Qaraye Marchants</h1>
    <p style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--cyan); margin-bottom: 40px;">NIGERIA'S AGRICULTURAL MARKETPLACE</p>

    <div style="color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.9; font-size: 1rem;">
      <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--ink);">Qaraye Marchants connects Nigeria's agricultural merchants with buyers across the country. From premium grains and tubers to livestock and fresh produce, we make it easy to discover, verify, and purchase products directly from trusted sellers.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">Our Mission</h2>
      <p>To modernize agricultural trade in Nigeria by providing a transparent, secure, and reliable marketplace where merchants can grow their business and buyers can source quality products with confidence.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">What We Offer</h2>
      <ul style="line-height: 2;">
        <li><strong>Verified Merchants:</strong> Every seller is reviewed before listing products.</li>
        <li><strong>Safe Transactions:</strong> All purchases are processed through Qaraye Marchants Admin for buyer protection.</li>
        <li><strong>Wide Selection:</strong> Grains, tubers, livestock, fruits, vegetables, seeds, and agricultural inputs.</li>
        <li><strong>Direct Connection:</strong> Buyers and sellers connect quickly without unnecessary middlemen.</li>
        <li><strong>Nationwide Reach:</strong> Products from all 36 states and the FCT.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">Why Buyers Trust Us</h2>
      <p>We vet our merchants, moderate all listings, and enforce strict rules against off-platform contact sharing. Every purchase inquiry goes through our admin team, ensuring that both buyers and sellers are protected throughout the transaction.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">For Merchants</h2>
      <p>Qaraye Marchants gives agricultural merchants a professional online storefront with no setup fees. List your products, manage inventory from your dashboard, and reach buyers nationwide. Bulk import lets you add hundreds of products in minutes.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@qarayemarchants.com.ng" style="color: var(--cyan);">support@qarayemarchants.com.ng</a><br>
        <strong>WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/2348037411688" style="color: var(--cyan);" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+234 803 741 1688</a><br>
        <strong>Contact Page:</strong> <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--cyan);">Visit our contact page</a>
      </p>

      <div style="margin-top: 48px; padding: 28px; background: var(--cyan-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Ready to get started?</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Browse products or list yours today.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/products" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 12px 24px;">Browse Marketplace</a>
          <a href="/dashboard/create-listing" class="btn btn-ghost" style="padding: 12px 24px;">List a Product</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>